#'   and `autorangeoptions.clipmax`.
#'
#'   Any value.
#' @param maxallowed Use this value exactly as autorange maximum.
#'
#'   Any value.
#' @param minallowed Use this value exactly as autorange minimum.
#'
#'   Any value.
